Adapted parts, rewritten in JavaScript and changed:
- extension/shrink.js: from engine/compressors (log.go, terminal.go, tabular.go,
  json.go, redundancy.go, invariants.go, lineends.go) and engine/detect.go.
- extension/voice.js: the caveman and ultra voice texts from skills/caveman,
  skills/ultracave and src/rules/caveman-activate.md, and the trigger parser
  from src/hooks/caveman-parse.js. In Mumble, these are the mumble and ultra
  voices and the /mumble triggers.
- extension/store.js: the recovery contract of the CCR store (no original on
  disk, no lossy output). The code is new.

The "ste" voice and the head-and-tail cut are not from Caveman.
